{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261113/photo/bkn-20261113232656089-1113_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261113233647\"/><p>失蹤女子梁佩蘭。</p><p>執法部門今日（13日）呼籲市民提供一名在長洲失蹤女子的消息。梁佩蘭(65歲)女子本月11日下午在長洲渡輪碼頭最後露面後便告失蹤，其家人今日報案。她身高約1.6米，體重約60公斤，中等身材，圓面型，黃皮膚及蓄黑啡短髮。她最後露面時身穿黑色長袖衫、藍色格仔外套、綠色長褲、黑色鞋，以及攜有一個黑色背包。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T16:24:31.795855+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T15:26:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:53.845208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:53.845208+00:00","content_hash":"63c139836e4fafbbff49e3e3209ff29d0afad7c722f421e4feac8746a7f27c09","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}